0001\"}}, \"source_type\": \"announcement\", \"record_kind\": \"channel_announcement\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-08-24T14:20:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-08-24T14:20:00Z\", \"created_at\": \"2026-08-24T14:20:00.700001+00:00\", \"valid_until\": \"2026-08-28T21:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": true}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"audio_multimodal\", \"batch_id\": \"audio_batch_05\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"other_batch\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"MESSAGE_AUTHOR\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_slack_archive\"}, \"authorship\": {\"author_id\": \"U006\", \"verified\": true, \"basis\": \"SLACK_MESSAGE_AUTHOR\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"tl_approved\", \"decision_status\": \"tl_approved\", \"execution_status\": \"posted\", \"outcome_status\": \"not_observed\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[HISTORICAL - NOT CURRENT GUIDANCE: valid_until 2026-08-28T21:00:00Z has passed. May explain an old rule; do not apply it as current.]\\nAudio batch 05: through Friday, August 28, try at most one reload when the player is stuck at 00:00. Keep the task ID, browser state, whether the waveform appears, and whether another clip plays. If playback is still unavailable, report the tool incident; do not assign a content-quality failure or content QN solely from the player failure. A reload is a diagnostic trial, not a confirmed repair or submission receipt. We will review the results before extending this approach.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:audio-multimodal-faq@1.1:c724358c\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"CURRENT_GUIDANCE\", \"citation\": {\"authoring\": \"audio-multimodal-faq@1.1\", \"title\": \"Audio Multimodal — FAQ (v1.1)\", \"sections\": [\"Playback and tool issues\"], \"source\": {\"manual_key\": \"audio-multimodal-faq\", \"system\": \"manual\"}}, \"source_type\": \"faq\", \"record_kind\": \"faq\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-20T13:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-20T13:00:00Z\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"audio_multimodal\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"project_wide\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U006\", \"actor_relation\": \"RECORD_AUTHORITY\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_manual_record\"}, \"authorship\": {\"verified\": false, \"basis\": \"NO_AUTHOR_RECORDED\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"approved\"}, \"excerpt\": \"## Playback and tool issues\\n\\n### Q: What if the player spins forever or never loads?\\nReport the task ID and available reproduction details as a tool incident. Do not score the recording as a model-quality failure while it cannot be evaluated.\\n\\n### Q: Can I use QN because playback is unavailable?\\nPlayback failure alone does not establish a content-based QN reason. Report the tool incident. If other accessible evidence raises a separate content concern, retain it for review rather than assuming what the unavailable audio contains.\"}, {\"evidence_id\": \"k:slack:C_AUDIO_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790892000.000901:1c524924\", \"origin\": \"retrieved_source\", \"use\": \"ANNOUNCEMENT\", \"citation\": {\"title\": \"Slack announcement in audio-multimodal-announcements at 2026-10-01T22:00:00.000901+00:00\", \"source\": {\"channel_id\": \"C_AUDIO_ANNOUNCEMENTS\", \"message_id\": \"1790892000.000901\", \"system\": \"slack\", \"thread_id\": \"1790892000.000901\"}}, \"source_type\": \"announcement\", \"record_kind\": \"announcement\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-10-0